{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-12_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-12",
  "title": "Fireworks Sear Scarlet",
  "storyCode": "13-14",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-12_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bb7f4c2edf5933c0fd82169f348ea6f924c5c83bd05712da139917bdb4250b4e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "You didn't bring my order to my tent... Magdelene.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "And you didn't leave Brentwood either. A pitiful decision.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Why didn't you leave?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "This is my home.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Do you have a new order for me? I can bring it to you along with the flowers last night.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "...You don't have to worry about those orders anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "I'm here to say goodbye.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "I'm leaving soon... to fight as part of the Nachzehrer King's army...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Alright...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Goodbye, if that's what you wanted to hear from me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "You're too naive... to the point of foolishness.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Everything that I've tried to protect, always courts its own destruction.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Perhaps I've been wrong from the start.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I don't understand what you're saying, <i>Shovel.</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "I used to be incredibly jealous of all of you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Victoria used to be the noblest and strongest nation there was. Naturally, you possessed many great things, and rightfully so.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "With the metallurgy you originated and the Steam Knights, you conquered another empire. With your mystifying art and rich academia, you attracted all of Terra's geniuses...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Yet now, you've halted your outward conquest. Now, your rulers only indulge in parties and wine, only ever boasting about the medals on their chest.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "They crush their own glory, and they are destined to be replaced—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Hm? You still have this wall clock...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Time really flies. The town's citizens must all have gone to the work site.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "What do you mean?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Your deaths are unavoidable, Magdelene.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "The Sanguinarch is an impatient man.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "That's why the ritual was pushed forward, and under that Feline's leadership, the mission was indeed completed most marvelously.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Everyone here will be the key to the ritual's activation.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Of course, that includes you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Freda",
      "text": "He was stopped by the devils at the Sarkaz barracks just now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Freda... Do you see that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I need to go find Freda!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Let me go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "You mustn't leave this greenhouse.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Wait a little longer, Magdelene. I'll be here with you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Until we bid each other farewell for the last time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Why... The people of the town have never done anything against your wishes!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Freda and everyone fulfilled each and every one of your requests!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "His Highness decided to carry out this war, and your dukes responded. This outcome has nothing to do with us or you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "All we need to do is follow our orders.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Then let me warn the people at the work site! Just pretend you don't know anything like before, please!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "I serve His Highness, and I won't allow you to quash this ritual...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Not unless you make it past me, Magdelene.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Royal Court Junior Officer",
      "text": "Can you do it, <i>Gardener?</i>",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "Magdelene, where are you going? Why the rush?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "Is that... blood on your clothes...? Are you okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "It's fine—I cut my finger while I was pruning branches...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Henk, where's Freda?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "Freda? After she came back from the barracks by herself this morning, she went straight to the Sarkaz officers.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "She seemed rather out of it, and she kept saying sorry no matter who she ran into.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "Did something happen?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Everyone has to leave this place right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "And the farther, the better!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "What's with all of you being so bloody barmy today?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "There's no time to explain. I need to tell everyone else!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "But we're almost finished! Besides, if we all ditch work, what are we supposed to do when those officers find us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "Fireworks? Where?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skeptical Citizen",
      "text": "Who blew that wall open? Is that... Freda?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Civilian",
      "text": "What just happened? Is there an earthquake?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Woman",
      "text": "R-Run!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frightened Civilian",
      "text": "You're bleeding... Bollocks... Stay away! Those disgusting monsters are dripping from your body!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "What are the Sarkaz trying to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Henk, Henk! You can't close your eyes...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "I... I'm starting to feel very tired too... So sleepy...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Magdelene! Hang in there!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Captain, I got her!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Everyone, hold onto the ropes as tight as you can. Do not touch the ground, no matter what!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Hurry and help them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Magdelene, you can't fall asleep!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Rockrock?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "This guy's so heavy!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Unconscious Civilian",
      "text": "Mmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Feist... The Self-Salvation Corps... Why are you...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "We figured something went wrong when we saw fireworks in the middle of the day! They sealed the wall we blew open yesterday, but that cannon gave us a new path.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Hold onto Rockrock's hand, Magdelene! Our forces don't have enough manpower, and we're bringing everyone to evacuate as soon as we can!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Woahh! Feist, your zipline's even faster after those modifications you made!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Right, where is Mayor Freda? We haven't been able to locate her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "...Freda is—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Drat, why did my zipline start shaking?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "What about that weak garrison commander? Where is he hiding this time?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Well, no matter... I'll take over command.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "I can feel it. My blood... is boiling.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "No need to contact Major Ulšulah's squad. We can take care of these laughable Victorians by ourselves.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "Kill them all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "The garrison here is mounting a counter-attack. They're putting more pressure on us than any Sarkaz we've faced before!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "How much explosive does Old Weiss still have outside? Can he make it here in time to back us up?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Probably not happening. Not counting the members who laid the ziplines for us, we barely had any fighting men to begin with.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Start the Crawlers! We need to break through by force!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Rockrock, watch out! Your zipline!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Ah—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "That hurts—\nMagdelene, are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Can you walk? Gah, these disgusting things—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "This is the Prince's blessing. It's the kindness the Royal Court left for us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Mercenary",
      "text": "In our bodies... our purest blood is now awakening. Let's waste no more time on these Victorians!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Rockrock, you should go—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Magdelene, get ready to fight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "It's not that hard. None of us... had any combat experience before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Take a deep breath and make up your mind.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rockrock",
      "text": "Artillery fire? I thought we used up all our explosives!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "Quick, Rockrock, Magdelene, now!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "We were contacted by a few old friends. They brought a whole backup unit! They even have an identification code—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "'The Exemplars!'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "This is Tank Fire Team Horn. All units, make sure to stay clear of my blast zone.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Grenade loaded. Firing second barrage!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Horn",
      "text": "Opening created. Cover the Self-Salvation Corps and all citizens!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Horn, continue laying suppressive fire.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Those Arts Circles... We need to find a way to stop this bloody witchcraft.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Vina, have someone else drive. I want to join the ground combat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Hannah, eyes on the road!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Indra",
      "text": "Alright, alright!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Get the tank as close to the core of the Arts Circle as possible. I'll take care of that thing!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Morgan",
      "text": "Vina!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "You have other tasks.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "All units, follow regular deployment formation. Morgan, Hannah, follow Horn's orders and cut open a path for the tank.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Lieutenant Shearer, Dagda, Delphine, take command of the ground forces and form a defensive line. Stop the Sanguinarch's worms.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Delphine",
      "text": "I'm on it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Shearer",
      "text": "Acknowledged.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dagda",
      "text": "Acknowledged.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Mr. Misery, I'll leave the commander of the enemy forces to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "text": "All you need to do is boldly execute your plan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Feist, it's been a while. We shall exchange pleasantries later. I need the Self-Salvation Corps to help set up a zipline that will take me above the Arts Circle.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Feist",
      "text": "On it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "We have no time to lose. Let us take care of the strange Arts Circle first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "I will leave my rear to all of you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheering Civilian",
      "text": "Look! Look how easily our Victorian tank fire can blast that thing apart!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheering Civilian",
      "text": "We said as much long ago. Them bloody devils are no match for Victoria's military!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cheering Civilian",
      "text": "Crush them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "No, there are too many Originium crystals in town...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "The mayor's office, the small town square, the library... those things we've been rebuilding day in and day out...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "We won't make it in time—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Magdelene",
      "text": "Is it over?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "The Arts Circle has been damaged. The Vampires' offspring have gone berserk. Seize this opportunity!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Infantry units, stop advancing. Escort all citizens out of the Arts Circle's range.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Siege",
      "text": "Tank squad, follow me and push forward. Destroy the remaining Originium crystals in the town and commence search and rescue!",
